@url = http://localhost:5501

### MCP Card - manifest serwera
GET {{url}}/mcp/card

### Lista narzędzi (filtrowane po roli)
POST {{url}}/
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Role: client

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": "1",
  "method": "tools/list"
}

### Wywołaj list_my_inquiries (scoped do użytkownika, semantyczna odpowiedź)
POST {{url}}/
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Role: client
X-User-Id: 10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002
# X-User-Id: 10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000123456 # user from antipattern demo

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": "2",
  "method": "tools/call",
  "params": {
    "name": "list_my_inquiries",
    "arguments": {
      "page": 1,
      "limit": 10
    }
  }
}
